      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْضَدُ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَخَضِّدٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَثَنٍّ</span> [app. as meaning (assumed tropical:)  <i>Affecting an inclining of the body,</i> or <i>a
